{"id":"Wa06990723dd2c71b8ffe72b2","zh":"层间离缝","en":"","name":"层间离缝","language":"zh","domain":"环境振动与轨道减振","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":"轨道结构相邻层界面出现分离或间隙的状态。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wa06990723dd2c71b8ffe72b2","text":"层间离缝","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S6c92a83d4541fdde326c","source_id":"P120","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"齐少轩等 [1]根据现场调研情况将道岔板与砂浆层层间离缝归纳为4种典型形式,对不同离缝工况下的轨道结构受力进行研究。","citations":[{"source_id":"P120","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Seb064c63a6325f673f6d","source_id":"P120","page":10,"page_end":10,"language":"zh","text":"层间离缝状态下,离缝纵向增长至一定长度后轨道板受力将进入塑性软化阶段,此时可采用损伤塑性模型描述轨道板混凝土的损伤演化过程。","citations":[{"source_id":"P120","page":10,"page_end":10}]},{"id":"Sca34dd12fe5ed8f025dc","source_id":"P136","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"故本文针对基础变形区域隧道地段弹性支承块式无砟轨道,采用Abaqus 有限元分析软件建立静力学空间有限元分析模型,以仰拱不均匀沉降作为基础变形输入形式,探讨在不同变形幅值和不同波长作用下,钢轨、道床板及层间离缝的变化发展规律,以期为基础变形区域隧道地段无砟轨道的优化设计与运维提供参考。","citations":[{"source_id":"P136","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"S0e73ff714526a2e7e02f","source_id":"P136","page":8,"page_end":8,"language":"zh","text":"根据上文研究可知,沉降中心为板端时离缝及脱空高度略小于沉降中心为板中,但长度大于沉降中心为板中,在小幅值工况下更为突出, 可认为当沉降中心为板端时层间离缝及脱空情况较为严重,故本节针对沉降中心为板端的情况进行研究。","citations":[{"source_id":"P136","page":8,"page_end":8}]}],"sources":{"P097":{"id":"P097","title":"Study on the dynamic performance of the vehicle-ballastless track system subjected to dislocation of fault zone","authors":"Z Li, W Wang, L Xu, J Peng","year":"2025","doi":"10.1016/j.advengsoft.2025.103938","journal_citation":"Advances in Engineering Software 207, 103938","label":"Li等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-study-on-the-dynamic-performance-of-the-vehicle-ballastless-track-system-subjected-to-dislocation-of"},"P120":{"id":"P120","title":"不同累积概率不平顺状态下轨道板离缝损伤研究","authors":"陈宪麦,王日吉,徐磊,潘燕萍,彭良坤,李忠","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20221064","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-damage-of-track-slab-under-different-cumulative-probability-irregularity"},"P136":{"id":"P136","title":"基础变形对弹性支承块式无砟轨道变形及离缝影响研究","authors":"曾志平,吴霁崟,王卫东,王继军,徐磊,李桩,刘卓","year":"2025","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20240581","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"曾志平等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-study-on-the-deformation-and-the-gap-of-low-vibration-track-under-the-influence-of-foundation-deform"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"轨道板与CA砂浆之间失去贴合和支承的区域。","language":"zh","source_id":"P120","paper_slug":"2023-damage-of-track-slab-under-different-cumulative-probability-irregularity","title":"不同累积概率不平顺状态下轨道板离缝损伤研究","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"道床板与仰拱之间产生的分离，以间隙高度和纵向长度表征。","language":"zh","source_id":"P136","paper_slug":"2025-study-on-the-deformation-and-the-gap-of-low-vibration-track-under-the-influence-of-foundation-deform","title":"基础变形对弹性支承块式无砟轨道变形及离缝影响研究","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"底座与土体局部分离形成的间隙，影响动态支承和接触。","language":"zh","source_id":"P097","paper_slug":"2025-study-on-the-dynamic-performance-of-the-vehicle-ballastless-track-system-subjected-to-dislocation-of","title":"断层带错动作用下车辆—无砟轨道系统动力性能研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wde30916e681ade2529672d2c","name":"gap between layers","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"Wf8bf564ae59590e35695b9fe","name":"interlayer separation","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"W12ece5489ffa55e76a328012","name":"Interlayer void","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wde30916e681ade2529672d2c","name":"gap between layers","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"Wf8bf564ae59590e35695b9fe","name":"interlayer separation","language":"en","kin